 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Graphic: NOAA 🌀 Tropical Storm Isaias is forecast to become the season's first Atlantic hurricane overnight, with impacts across the Gulf Coast and up into the interior Southeast. It would be the latest-forming Atlantic hurricane in the modern era. Latest forecast ... More from Axios' Carlie Kollath Wells . 💊 Scientists Henri B. Kagan of France and Kenso Soai of Japan won the Nobel Prize in chemistry for untangling mysterious mirror images in molecules, a discovery that's been used to develop countless drugs. Go deeper . ⛳️ Spanish golf star Jon Rahm is exiting LIV Golf after deeming the league's reinvention plan "unacceptable." His departure marks a significant blow to the effort to create "LIV 2.0" after the league filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection. More from Nathan Bomey . 
 
