 4. 🚛 1 for the road: Move to Detroit, get $15K 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Brendan Lynch/Axios A new Detroit nonprofit is giving money to people who move to or pledge to stay in the Motor City, Axios Detroit's Annalise Frank reports. 

 💰 The first 13 winners of Move Detroit's "Make Detroit Home" grants are getting $15,000 each.

 It's the first stage of the program, supported by billionaire and Rocket Mortgage co-founder Dan Gilbert. CEO Hilary Doe said at a press conference: "This program is data-backed and focuses resources on our city's greatest asset: our people."

